<title>USA: PHLX to trade three new options this week.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade three new options this week.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Tuesday it will begin trading options on NS Group Inc and Source Media Inc on August 6.</p>
<p>It also said it will begin trading options on Registry Inc on August 8.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits and specialist.</p>
<p>Strikes	 Expir	 Pos Lts   Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>20, 22-1/2,   Sep, Oct,   4,500     GPZ Trading</p>
<p>25		Jan, Apr</p>
<p>7-1/2, 10,    Sep, Oct,   4,500     Group One Ltd</p>
<p>12-1/2	  Jan, Apr</p>
<p>45, 50, 55    Sep, Oct,   4,500     TFM Investment</p>
<p>		  Nov, Feb</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
